   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISD201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Information Systems in the Digital Age — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14525 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ISD201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Information Systems in the Digital Age — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14525 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">ISD201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Information Systems in the Digital Age_Hệ thống thông tin trong kỷ nguyên số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h (60 sessions) contact hours + 180-minute final exam + 102h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">DXE291c, DBI202</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Offline,In-class lecture, Social Constructivism, Active Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">14525</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/21/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/21/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">ISD201</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Information Systems in the Digital Age_Hệ thống thông tin trong kỷ nguyên số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h (60 sessions) contact hours + 180-minute final exam + 102h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">DXE291c, DBI202</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Offline,In-class lecture, Social Constructivism, Active Learning</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">14525</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/21/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/21/2026</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This course provides an overview of how information systems support business operations, decision-making, and digital transformation in modern organizations. Students will explore core topics such as business processes, enterprise systems, databases, networks, cybersecurity, e-commerce, knowledge management and artificial intelligence. The course emphasizes how organizations use information systems strategically to achieve operational excellence, improve decision-making, and gain competitive advantage, so that learners know how information systems are transforming global business, and why they are so essential for running and managing a business today. Through real-world case studies and practical activities, students will analyze the structure of digital firms, model business processes, and evaluate system solutions. Key technologies such as cloud computing, data analytics, and business intelligence are introduced. Ethical and social issues related to data and systems use are also discussed. The course bridges business needs with IT capabilities, equipping students with foundational knowledge to work at the intersection of business and technology.</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>In the case: (5 &gt; Final TE Score &gt;=4) &amp; (5 &gt; Final PE Score &gt;=4) &amp; FR &lt; 5, the student can choose to take the resit of both TE &amp; PE OR just either TE or PE.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This course provides an overview of how information systems support business operations, decision-making, and digital transformation in modern organizations. Students will explore core topics such as business processes, enterprise systems, databases, networks, cybersecurity, e-commerce, knowledge management and artificial intelligence. The course emphasizes how organizations use information systems strategically to achieve operational excellence, improve decision-making, and gain competitive advantage, so that learners know how information systems are transforming global business, and why they are so essential for running and managing a business today. Through real-world case studies and practical activities, students will analyze the structure of digital firms, model business processes, and evaluate system solutions. Key technologies such as cloud computing, data analytics, and business intelligence are introduced. Ethical and social issues related to data and systems use are also discussed. The course bridges business needs with IT capabilities, equipping students with foundational knowledge to work at the intersection of business and technology.</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>In the case: (5 &gt; Final TE Score &gt;=4) &amp; (5 &gt; Final PE Score &gt;=4) &amp; FR &lt; 5, the student can choose to take the resit of both TE &amp; PE OR just either TE or PE.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14525</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14525</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
